# Mostawsef - Project Architecture

Locally installed **Clinic Management System**: desktop app + local REST backend + local database.
Full decisions: `Docs/foundation.md`. UI system: `Docs/ui-foundation.md`. Components: `Docs/shared-components.md`.

## Tech stack (locked)
- .NET 10 (C#), solution `Mostawsef.slnx` at the repo root
- Backend: ASP.NET Core Web API (controllers)
- Frontend: Avalonia 12 (XAML, MVVM with CommunityToolkit.Mvvm), Fluent theme + our tokens
- Database: PostgreSQL 17 (Docker in development, native install on clinic PCs)
- ORM: EF Core 10 + Npgsql
- UI languages: Arabic (RTL, default) and English, switchable at runtime; Light and Dark themes

## Structure
```
backend/Mostawsef.Api             controllers, middleware, startup
backend/Mostawsef.Application     use cases, services, interfaces
backend/Mostawsef.Domain          entities, enums, business rules (depends on nothing)
backend/Mostawsef.Infrastructure  EF Core, DbContext, repositories
shared/Mostawsef.Contracts        request/response DTOs shared by API and desktop
frontend/Mostawsef.Desktop        Avalonia app
```

## Hard rules
- The desktop app talks to the backend **only over HTTP/REST**. It never references backend projects and never connects to the database.
- Dependency direction: Domain <- Application <- Infrastructure <- Api. Desktop -> Contracts only.
- EF Core / Npgsql packages live only in Infrastructure (Api has `EntityFrameworkCore.Design` for tooling only).
- Modular monolith: organize by feature modules (`Application/Modules/<Feature>`), no microservices.
- Keep SQLite as a possible fallback: no `jsonb`, arrays, `citext`, `EF.Functions.ILike` or raw SQL; store money as integers (smallest unit).
- Auth: username/password users with roles `Admin` and `Super` (JWT); each role has its own desktop portal. Details: `Docs/auth.md`.
- Do not add business logic or business modules unless the user asks for them.

## Commands
```powershell
docker compose up -d                                   # dev PostgreSQL
dotnet build Mostawsef.slnx
dotnet run --project backend/Mostawsef.Api --launch-profile http   # http://localhost:5270/api/health
dotnet run --project frontend/Mostawsef.Desktop
```
